# Intermediate matrices for the O'Nan generator relations

Explicit repeated-squaring witnesses for B⁴ = 1 and (AB)¹¹ = 2I over GF(7).
`Relations.lean` checks every matrix product by kernel reduction; these tables
are data, not trusted computational results. The inputs are the ATLAS matrices
preserved and attributed in `refs/original/onan/README.md`.
-/

